%% AegisFlight — tamper-evident event logging (per-run SHA-256 hash chain)
flowchart LR
    A["ThreatAssessment<br/>(is_alert = true)"] --> B["canonical JSON<br/>(sorted keys)"]
    P["prev_hash<br/>(last hash in this run,<br/>GENESIS if first)"] --> H
    B --> H["hash = SHA-256(prev_hash || canonical)"]
    H --> ROW["events row<br/>(fields + prev_hash + hash)"]
    ROW --> DB[("SQLite<br/>logging/store.py")]

    DB --> V["verify_chain(run_id)"]
    V --> OK{"recompute each hash<br/>== stored hash?"}
    OK -->|yes| VALID["chain intact"]
    OK -->|no| BROKEN["broken_at = i<br/>(insert/edit/delete detected)"]
